{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このアイコンで755やってます✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大した話してないけど\nよろしければ遊びにいらしてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「伊藤かりん（乃木坂46）のトーク」\nhttp://7gogo.jp/lp/mQefyXKRyixWkVIvojdMdG=="},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の握手会で\nサプライズ発表されたこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム発売"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"overtureついに音源化きた＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木ライブ(ダイジェスト版)\nDVDで帰ってくるーーー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブfinal"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャパ10倍やばい！やばい！\nあの大きさの会場だったから\n良いと言われていた\n距離感や臨場感、一体感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広くなったからだめだとか\n言われないように\nまた頑張りますよーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムのカップリング投票の\n結果発表とかもあるし、\n去年みたいに楽しくみんなで\nクリスマス気分味わいましょう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の\nNOGIBINGO!3観てくださった方\nびっくりさせてしまって\nすみません(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかねー、女の子含め人間が\n至近距離にいるのが苦手で～..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"触れること自体は大丈夫だけど\n近すぎるのが苦手なの～(๑´0`๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから二期生とかでじゃれあってても\n誰も私には抱きついて来ないよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は抱きついたりしないから(笑)\n全然大丈夫なんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手無しでも話にだけ行くよ！とか\n距離遠めで行くね！とか\nみんな気遣ってくれたけど\n全然大丈夫だから安心してね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しいね...本当に。\nありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/07/8655220/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日